# Vendored sources are fetched on demand by the unified fetcher (wave 2).
# Everything under vendor/ is gitignored except the registry, this file,
# the README, the lockfile (added in wave 2), and the package.json that marks
# sources.ts an ES module when eslint/ruby-compat-needs-mri-citation.mjs
# imports it under Node's type stripping.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!sources.ts
!sources.lock.json
!package.json
!fetch.ts
!*.test.ts
